    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are pleased to offer 120 Raheny Road to the sales market. A unique opportunity is offered to acquire a deceptively spacious 5 bed detached home which comes to the market with accommodation extending to c. 146sq.m and generous sized gardens front & rear. There is a large garage c. 15sq.m set back from the house to side, suitable for conversion subject to planning permission. This could be used for a variety of uses. Built in the 1960`s by Park Developments this solidly built home offers an intending purchaser the opportunity to create their forever home. The property is walking distance to a wide choice of amenities bus links, DART station and shopping facilities. Viewing of this wonderful property highly recommended. \n\nThe location is second to none, with every conceivable amenity available within walking distance, choice of schools, shops, restaurants, coffee shops, churches and library. Nearby DART station and bus links to the city centre are easily accessible from the house. Dublin International Airport, M1/M50 motorways and East Point Business Park are easily accessible. St. Anne`s Park and Dollymount Beach are other nearby amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Entrance\nSliding porch door.\n\nReception Hall\nPainted floorboards.\n\nDownstairs wc & whb\nUnder sink storage.\n\nLounge - 6.49m (21'4\") x 3.76m (12'4\")\nMarble fireplace. Laminate flooring.\n\nDining Room - 5.29m (17'4\") x 3.3m (10'10\")\nFeature fireplace.\n\nKitchen - 5.25m (17'3\") x 3.06m (10'0\")\nRange of fitted press units. Tiled behind worktop. Plumbed for washing machine & dishwasher. Sliding patio door to rear.\n\nLanding\nHotpress with insulated immersion tank.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.8m (12'6\") x 3.78m (12'5\")\nBuilt in wardrobes and vanity unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.18m (10'5\") x 3.13m (10'3\")\nBuilt in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.15m (10'4\") x 2.59m (8'6\")\nBuilt in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.63m (11'11\") x 3.07m (10'1\")\nDual view. Separate shower tray.\n\nBedroom 5 - 2.68m (8'10\") x 2.65m (8'8\")\nBuilt in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom\nBath, with shower attachment, screen, whb and wc. Fully tiled floor & walls.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Aluminium single/double glazed windows </li><li> Oil central heating </li><li> Downstairs wc </li><li> Garage to side 5.14m x 3.01m </li><li> Off street parking </li><li> 5 bedrooms </li><li> Walking distance of Raheny DART station</li></ul>"
      },
